{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301350","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301350","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1130135001:1":{"text":"Alkali. Ever heard of it?","source_cn":"咸水镇，听说过吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1378252B70010E04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130135002:1":{"text":"I'm told that the people of that town are tough, and I'm a bit worried about running into trouble there.","source_cn":"据说那个镇子的民风彪悍，我真担心到了那里遇到什么问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1C594DE3C14B81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130135003:1":{"text":"But that's the thing about business, you can't expect every deal to go down without a hitch.","source_cn":"不过赚钱就是这样，你不可能要求每单生意都万无一失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99F26D583FEBFA25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130135004:1":{"text":"What's that desert saying? \"The bigger the sandstorm, the shinier the diamond.\"","source_cn":"那句话怎么说来着，“荒漠上的沙暴越大，荒漠的皮毛就越贵”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CF85CE51E44A748","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人塔林塔":{"text":"Trader Ted","source":"商人塔林塔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}